@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Health Check (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### MIXED OPERATIONS & MULTI-NUMBER EXPRESSIONS (PEMDAS / BODMAS)
### ============================================================================

### 2. Mixed Expression String: 5+2×3 (200 OK -> 11)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "5+2×3"
}

### 3. Multi-Number Expression String: 1+6+9+5+3 (200 OK -> 24)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "1+6+9+5+3"
}

### 4. Mixed Operations Array: 5 + 2 * 3 (200 OK -> 11)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numbers": [5, 2, 3],
  "operations": ["add", "multiply"]
}

### 5. Mixed Operations Array All Precedence Levels: 20 - 12 / 3 + 2 ^ 3 (200 OK -> 24)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numbers": [20, 12, 3, 2, 3],
  "operations": ["subtract", "divide", "add", "exponent"]
}

### 6. Complex Expression with Parentheses & Square Root: (5+2)×3 + √144 (200 OK -> 33)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "(5+2)×3 + √144"
}

### 7. Multi-Number Single Operation: 1 + 6 + 9 + 5 + 3 (200 OK -> 24)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "add",
  "numbers": [1, 6, 9, 5, 3]
}

### ============================================================================
### STANDARD SINGLE OPERATIONS
### ============================================================================

### 8. Addition - Floating-Point Precision IEEE 754 (200 OK -> 0.3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "add",
  "numbers": [0.1, 0.2]
}

### 9. Subtraction - Multiple Numbers (200 OK -> 60)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "subtract",
  "numbers": [100, 20, 15, 5]
}

### 10. Multiplication - Multiple Numbers (200 OK -> 120)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "multiply",
  "numbers": [2, 3, 4, 5]
}

### 11. Division (200 OK -> 6.25)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "divide",
  "numbers": [25, 4]
}

### 12. Exponentiation - 2^10 (200 OK -> 1024)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "exponent",
  "numbers": [2, 10]
}

### 13. Percentage - 15% of 200 (200 OK -> 30)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "percent",
  "numbers": [200, 15]
}

### 14. Square Root - Unary Operation (200 OK -> 12)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "sqrt",
  "numbers": [144]
}

### ============================================================================
### EDGE CASES & ERROR VALIDATION
### ============================================================================

### 15. Division by Zero in Mixed Expression (422 Unprocessable Entity -> DIVISION_BY_ZERO)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "5 + 10 ÷ (3 - 3)"
}

### 16. Negative Square Root (422 Unprocessable Entity -> NEGATIVE_SQRT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "sqrt",
  "numbers": [-25]
}

### 17. Numeric Overflow +Inf (422 Unprocessable Entity -> NUMERIC_OVERFLOW)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "exponent",
  "numbers": [10, 1000]
}

### 18. Invalid Expression Syntax (400 Bad Request -> INVALID_EXPRESSION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "5 + * 3"
}

### 19. Invalid Operation (400 Bad Request -> INVALID_OPERATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "modulo",
  "numbers": [10, 3]
}

### 20. Missing Second Operand on Binary Operation (400 Bad Request -> MISSING_NUMBERS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "add",
  "numbers": [10]
}
